  "notes": "The exact 1913 title page and later Mysl and scholarly editions credit Ю. М. Антоновский. DNB GND 123235553 links the Cyrillic initials to Antonovskij, Julij Michajlovič, translator of Tak govoril Zaratustra; RSL expands the exact same initials in a Zarathustra record to Юлий Михайлович Антоновский (1857-1913). The legacy record ID retains `yuri` for stable lineage; the speaking filesystem route is `yuliy-antonovsky`. The earlier English form Yuri M. Antonovsky is rejected.",
